meta {
  name: Get Top Rated
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/tmdb/top-rated?type=movie&page=1&region={{region}}&language={{language}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  type: movie
  page: 1
  region: {{region}}
  language: {{language}}
}

docs {
  # Get Top Rated Content

  Fetches top-rated movies or TV shows from TMDB filtered by region and language.

  ## Query Parameters
  | Parameter | Type | Required | Default | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `type` | `string` | No | `movie` | Media type: `movie` or `tv`. |
  | `page` | `number` | No | `1` | Page number. |
  | `region` | `string` | No | `US` | ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 country code. |
  | `language` | `string` | No | `en-US` | Localization language tag. |

  ## Responses
  - **200 OK**: Paginated TMDB top-rated list.
  - **500 Internal Server Error**: `{ "error": "<message>" }`.
}

